{"id":"darkest-before","name":"Darkest Before","type":"Pulse Rifle","tier":"Legendary","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/75c2fdd914f5ec532db62b33d8cab92d.jpg","screenshot":"/common/destiny2_content/screenshots/435821040.jpg","columns":[{"label":"Barrel","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Arrowhead Brake","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8f7fb54687aa52a9c2595d90ce9c9417.png","desc":"Lightly vented barrel.\n  •  Greatly controls recoil\n  •  Increases handling speed"},{"name":"Chambered Compensator","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0b451cbccc7f11f6aec9c153e59474cb.png","desc":"Stable barrel attachment.\n  •  Increases stability\n  •  Moderately controls recoil\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Corkscrew Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7730e1732ed7ef91afce50277639c493.png","desc":"Balanced barrel. \n  •  Slightly increases range and stability\n  •  Slightly increases handling speed"},{"name":"Extended Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9e5e8fa07a84c29252b78b0e7b3106d.png","desc":"Weighty barrel extension.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Decreases handling speed\n  •  Moderately controls recoil"},{"name":"Fluted Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/260eba9dd149dbb94b1306c9ed4dd8db.png","desc":"Ultra-light barrel. \n  •  Greatly increases handling speed\n  •  Slightly increases stability"},{"name":"Full Bore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40a4bdcf0f5a4e492927f9569eaf529d.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for distance.\n  •  Greatly increases range\n  •  Decreases stability\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Hammer-Forged Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/2b9eb6d4489cffc18c10223279198bcc.png","desc":"Durable ranged barrel.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Polygonal Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d7aaccee29cf450d4057a9de871cdc8.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for recoil reduction.\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Smallbore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d1bb6a623f14959a47156ee71acfc3a.png","desc":"Dual strength barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Full Choke","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/629246e67fc8690d56b5478b0262131a.png","desc":"Tightened barrel. Reduces projectile spread when aiming down sights at the cost of precision damage."},{"name":"Rifled Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/79d5f1f469d3290cfb849f4b3e6fc16b.png","desc":"Ranged shotgun barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Greatly decreases handling speed"}]},{"label":"Magazine","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Extended Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/66cfea124e24e73cca1ce6370b44ca7e.png","desc":"This weapon has a greatly increased magazine size, but reloads much slower.\n  •  Greatly increases magazine size\n  •  Greatly decreases reload speed\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness"},{"name":"Alloy Magazine","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/069170916c98748b7b3e33b80bd7d689.png","desc":"Faster reload when the magazine is nearly empty."},{"name":"Appended Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9f468cce26fe35d9db413e2f8451127.png","desc":"This weapon's magazine is built for higher capacity.\n  •  Increases magazine size"},{"name":"Armor-Piercing Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b311ef00478243e21e2a5eec3a59f9d8.png","desc":"Rounds cause extra damage to combatants' shields and overpenetrate targets. \n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"High-Caliber Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d1c49edb2d2b24c74067742c09fd5a5.png","desc":"Shots from this weapon knock the target back farther.\n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Ricochet Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0a494d0442b32aff8c30d8b2b53561bd.png","desc":"Rounds ricochet off hard surfaces. \n  •  Increases stability \n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Flared Magwell","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f95e67e4ff37466505d66d3fa1030782.png","desc":"Optimized for fast reloading.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Greatly increases reload speed"},{"name":"Light Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/736b486ddb80beefacb4f09b5ad016eb.png","desc":"Improved reload and range.\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Accurized Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d85024478504205359c7fb52dbc4f6b6.png","desc":"This weapon can fire longer distances.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Tactical Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f0e309a267b25279a871d182f8910bcc.png","desc":"This weapon has multiple tactical improvements.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases magazine size"},{"name":"Drop Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d19f0c349652f0285bb5f999307b8a1.png","desc":"Increases reload speed but reduces magazine size."},{"name":"Steady Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6c6e1cc341487a8afd0b0c714a229255.png","desc":"This magazine is optimized for recoil control.\n  •  Greatly increases stability \n  •  Slightly decreases range\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness"}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Attrition Orbs","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c2092fae6ae58ca77a7f9b4434e688ef.png","desc":"Dealing sustained damage creates an Orb of Power."},{"name":"Elemental Capacitor","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e455d94dcafdab7a0d5a850712908020.png","desc":"Increased stats based on the currently equipped Super.\n• [Solar] increases your reload speed.\n• [Arc] increases handling.\n• [Void] increases stability.\n• [Stasis] moderately controls recoil and increases movement speed when aiming down sights.\n• [Strand] increases airborne effectiveness."},{"name":"Heal Clip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3d0f2eb4c1e4f66f2bd897ec4d5ce4f1.png","desc":"Reloading shortly after dealing a final blow grants Cure to you and your nearby allies."},{"name":"Deconstruct","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/91de2fd6a7756ba07d301a93e1e1cf29.png","desc":"Dealing sustained damage grants bonus damage against vehicles and constructs and refills ammo from reserves. Damage with Primary ammo or against constructs provides additional progress.\n\nConstructs include barricades, turrets, Stasis crystals, and other objects created in the field."},{"name":"Subsistence","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/eaa8f4295a71bf47df7ffd8599f7af4d.png","desc":"Defeating targets partially reloads the magazine from reserves."},{"name":"Wellspring","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ec2e3096ebd447bd6137735c9067b991.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon generate ability energy. This energy is divided between your uncharged abilities."},{"name":"Tunnel Vision","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ab0837be56c8d5cfc474acd4f3f9c7ac.png","desc":"Reloading after defeating a target greatly increases target acquisition and aim down sight speed for a short duration."},{"name":"Surplus","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a4c054c3547840300b9ce7ef11b7b6fc.png","desc":"Increases handling, reload speed, and stability for each fully charged ability."},{"name":"Overflow","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3165fec56b59363fa974a11f5730f4ec.png","desc":"Picking up Special or Heavy ammo automatically loads this weapon beyond normal capacity."},{"name":"Slideshot","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d41765e3db3a77da5cce27888c52d87.png","desc":"Sliding partially reloads this weapon's magazine and temporarily boosts range and stability."},{"name":"Quickdraw","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6893bb2c7ec7d13cb0d91ec9dd8b6500.png","desc":"This weapon can be drawn unbelievably fast."},{"name":"Light Touch","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/46b000a4e8c4ffa73df16c26a63360e0.png","desc":"This weapon gains reload speed, handling, and aim down sight speed when you are amplified, radiant, or have Devour."},{"name":"Keep Away","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/597cd0f1c5fe1f7681a1c129f8b958dd.png","desc":"Increases reload, range, and accuracy when no targets are in close proximity."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Headseeker","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/bdca577f8850f3c6168e9bc055019934.png","desc":"Body shots landed with this weapon increase precision damage and aim assist for a short time. Body shots landed while the perk is active refresh the time."},{"name":"Focused Fury","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/15fb47018719c99ae37d10f794bc957e.png","desc":"Dealing a portion of the magazine as precision damage grants this weapon bonus damage. The shot count is reset whenever the weapon is reloaded or stowed."},{"name":"Incandescent","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/22ed4a2cd5a0eb129a14ce77db49373f.png","desc":"Defeating a target spreads scorch to those nearby.\nMore powerful combatants and opposing Guardians cause scorch in a larger radius."},{"name":"Kill Clip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0afd4799427004b2d8170ab213a2ef0c.png","desc":"Reloading after a kill grants increased damage."},{"name":"One for All","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b1bce269c3cd21393131b4f5cffae692.png","desc":"Hitting three separate targets increases damage for a moderate duration."},{"name":"Surplus","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a4c054c3547840300b9ce7ef11b7b6fc.png","desc":"Increases handling, reload speed, and stability for each fully charged ability."},{"name":"Full Auto Trigger System","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/85059dae97dea2121091a0f787e20985.png","desc":"Holding down the trigger will fire this weapon at full auto."},{"name":"Elemental Capacitor","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e455d94dcafdab7a0d5a850712908020.png","desc":"Increased stats based on the currently equipped Super.\n• [Solar] increases your reload speed.\n• [Arc] increases handling.\n• [Void] increases stability.\n• [Stasis] moderately controls recoil and increases movement speed when aiming down sights.\n• [Strand] increases airborne effectiveness."},{"name":"Unrelenting","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/1e5843177c71ae3f2a4770d01a2f3813.png","desc":"Rapidly defeating targets triggers health regeneration. Guardians and powerful combatants count as more than one kill."},{"name":"Wellspring","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ec2e3096ebd447bd6137735c9067b991.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon generate ability energy. This energy is divided between your uncharged abilities."},{"name":"Rampage","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8976ead57430e4f5f8af1b3005de4f83.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon temporarily grant increased damage. Stacks 3x."},{"name":"Elemental Honing","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ac0323ff44f720a8db7ae9f4dee59af4.png","desc":"Dealing unique elemental damage grants this weapon a stacking damage bonus. This bonus is increased for kinetic weapons."},{"name":"Burning Ambition","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f7a2484668486f64020a612bd3dd5ab9.png","desc":"Dealing sustained damage scorches the target. Dealing damage to a scorched target inflicts scorch."}]},{"label":"Origin Trait","weight":0.5,"perks":[{"name":"Crossing Over","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/864b117b673162efe764921b13399b52.png","desc":"This weapon has increased range and handling for the top half of the magazine, while rounds from the bottom half of the magazine deal increased damage."}]}],"modes":{"all":{"rolls":[[0,14,27,46],[0,15,25,38],[0,15,31,46],[0,16,25,38],[0,16,31,46],[0,16,32,43],[1,15,31,46],[1,16,31,46],[1,16,32,43],[1,16,32,46],[1,16,41,43],[1,16,41,46],[4,15,31,46],[4,16,31,46],[8,14,31,46],[0,14,25,38],[0,14,31,46],[0,15,27,46],[0,15,32,46],[0,16,27,46],[0,16,32,46],[0,16,41,43],[0,16,41,46],[0,17,25,38],[1,14,31,46],[1,15,31,43],[1,15,32,43],[1,15,32,46],[1,15,41,43],[1,15,41,46],[1,16,31,43],[2,14,31,46],[2,15,31,46],[2,16,31,46],[2,16,32,43],[2,16,32,46],[2,16,41,43],[2,16,41,46],[4,14,31,46],[6,16,32,43],[6,16,32,46],[6,16,41,43],[6,16,41,46],[7,14,31,46],[7,15,31,46],[7,16